--   * referral_codes: a tenant sees/creates only its own code (no update/delete).
--   * referral_redemptions: visible to BOTH the referrer and the referred;
--     inserted only by the referred tenant, always as 'pending' with no credit
--     (a compromised tenant path cannot mint credits); never updated/deleted by
--     the app role (crediting happens on the owner/service connection).
--   * app.resolve_referral_code(code): SECURITY DEFINER lookup so the referred
